                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Damn... this is fun. I find myself starting it wanting to play like 1 round and end up playing at least like 10 or more. The ship diversity is nice, though I struggle with some of them, thats probably playstyle dependend though. I love the hockey mode, but deathmatch is awesome as well (except vs godly AI... wich... is just frustrating xD )\n\nAll in all really nice game, especially for that price! BUY IT!",
